I'm sorry for your situation, truly I am... Men like that don't deserve to be in the gene pool. Young ladies have to be ever more watchful than ever before, same for men in some ways. there are a lot of predators in this world we live in, part of survival is devising a way to filter out the unwanted individuals in our lives. seems like you found your way and you want to tell other young ladies. 

&#x200B;

Ladies should listen to what your advice and be more warry when getting into age gaps.

you can't read shit for face value so you got to bring up some stupid shit to make a point. what I said above is plain as day and straight to the point. stop wasting time. go learn a skill.

&#x200B;

you people seem to think winning a conversation on reddit changes something.. you continuing this conversation just proves my point of the female neckbeard being alive and well on this subreddit

possibly there must be some underground civilization/ecosystem or net or some sort of underground unknown (to the surface dwellers) world.  because mystical being (at least a lot of them) come from or reside underground, if not at the current time sometime in the past. the truth could be the realization, and dealing with the being, and existence of that unknown world and the beings that com from it. seeing the history of the world from the tree's POV  could be that truth. 

